// SM2.0 VS: loop aL/i#, rep, if b#/else, relative c[aL], int/bool constants, oPts, oT7
// ctab: Lights float 8 8 vector float 1 4
// ctab: NumLights int 0 1 scalar int 1 1
// ctab: UseFog bool 0 1 scalar bool 1 1
